                                                "sense_id": "07d58148-746b-3284-a9b5-7600395b4569",
                                                "text": "The way other children hear tell of Red Riding Hood and Goldilocks, I heard of this ‘Black Sparta’, the noble kingdom of Dahomey, fighting to hold off the French to the very end."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
